label mirrorUseWithNewspaperClip
I look into the mirror in the bathroom.
[background scene="res://scenes/dialogues/DialogicBackgroundScene.tscn" arg="res://assets/cgs/CGs_Mirror_Bathroom.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
[wait_input]
Despite everything, it's still you.
...
Near the sink, I find a newspaper clipping.
[background scene="res://scenes/dialogues/DialogicBackgroundScene.tscn" arg="res://assets/images/CG_NewspaperClipping.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
[i][b]2004-03-05\: SMALL-TOWN GIRL WINS PEACE PRIZE[/b][/i]
[i]Our community is celebrating today as one of our own has been awarded the International Peace Prize.[/i]
[i]In a brief interview, her proud mother recalled her unstoppable spirit\:[/i]
[i]"Whenever things got tough, she never backed down."[/i]
[i]"She would just clench her teeth and move forward, looking ahead with wide, clear eyes."[/i]
I add the newspaper clipping in my inventory
[end_timeline]
